- Identify the background color (most frequent value)
- Find all "special" non-background cells
- Group them into connected components of the same special value
- For each connected component of special cells, create a 1-pixel border around it (marking adjacent background cells as 1)
- Keep the special cells unchanged

In Demo 1: background=7, special=3, 1s form border around 3s
In Demo 2: background=7, special=8, 1s form border around connected 8s
In Demo 3: background=8, special=9, 1s form 1-pixel ring around connected 9s

